sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client Web / Mobile
    participant GW as API Gateway (8080)
    participant Auth as Auth Service (8081)
    participant Gamif as Gamification Service (8084)
    participant Rabbit as RabbitMQ (Exchange: skillquest.events)
    participant Comm as Community Service (8086)

    Note over Client,Rabbit: 1. Inscription & Initialisation Profil (Synchrone & Asynchrone)
    Client->>GW: POST /api/auth/register (Email, Mot de passe)
    GW->>Auth: Relaye la requête HTTP
    Auth->>Auth: Validation & Hachage BCrypt
    Auth->>Gamif: [REST Synchrone] POST /api/gamification/profiles
    Gamif-->>Auth: 201 Created (Profil initialisé avec 0 XP)
    Auth->>Rabbit: [Événement Publié] UserRegisteredEvent (auth.user.registered)
    Auth-->>GW: 201 Created (userId, JWT token)
    GW-->>Client: 201 Created

    Note over Comm,Auth: 2. Réaction à un Signalement d'Abus (Consommation Asynchrone)
    Comm->>Rabbit: [Événement Émis] UserReportedAbuseEvent (community.user.reported)
    Rabbit->>Auth: [Événement Consommé] UserReportedAbuseEvent
    Auth->>Auth: Analyse seuil (si > 3 abus: isActive = false)
